      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "What is your favorite color? What do you enjoy wearing?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-05T06:17:28.588387+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, my favorite color is orange! It reminds me of summer days when I used to spend time at the beach. What about you, what's your favorite color?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-05T06:26:43.163177+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, you are right. I like orange, too! And my favorite clothing style is pretty casual. What about you? Do you have any fashion trends that you love wearing?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-05T06:29:07.123975+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I also like casual clothes, Olivia. I think it's great that we can have a relaxed and comfortable conversation about our lives.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-05T06:34:29.171097+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, I see. So you also love casual clothes and beach-inspired colors? That's a good match!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-05T06:41:18.791627+00:00"
    },
    {
