      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Sure, summer is like a mini-vacation! It's warm, and you get to try out new activities. What about you? Have you been up to much in your travels this season?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-05T07:01:27.124041+00:00"
