      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "That's cool! I love trying out new hobbies. How about you? What kind of things do you like to do in your free time?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-05T07:14:30.586235+00:00"
